; Phase 41E: completing the last warband errand opened the Frostfang passage.
;
; ⚠️ IT NO LONGER DOES (maintainer direction, 2026-08-28). FrostfangReach.tres authors an empty
; UnlockFlagId, so nothing reads flag.frostfang.passage_open any more and the portal is open from the
; first minute. The flag is still WRITTEN here on purpose — it is the record that the warband line is
; finished, it costs nothing, and it is what a future reader (a dialogue line, a faction rank) would
; hang off. Do not delete it to tidy up; deleting a main quest's completion flag is a bigger change
; than the one that made it unread.

